s+='''</ol><h3>A daily diagnostic you can interpret</h3><p>Two multi-select questions and three short-response questions, ten marks total, about25 minutes plus checking. Record reasoning, attempt status, confidence and help. Answers and consolidation appear after recording a local attempt. The original attempt is kept separately from corrections; upload the export in the subject workspace for an Aleph submission and its existing AI feedback flow. A local unlock is not a server submission.</p><p>Classify misses as: problem/model interpretation, representation choice, invariant/state update, boundary/equality case, exact-count versus asymptotic reasoning, or unsupported conclusion. Diagnose the first broken step rather than calling an entire topic “weak” from one mistake.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>The next fourteen study days</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Day</th><th>Planned focus</th></tr></thead><tbody>'''
